-- A default on a fact the exported rule never reads carries nothing into the
-- consultation, so it costs nothing and is not refused: R5 is about what the
-- export would silently change, and this changes nothing.
ASSUME `has capacity` IS A BOOLEAN
ASSUME `is adult` IS A BOOLEAN
ASSUME `an unrelated fact` IS A BOOLEAN TYPICALLY TRUE

@export May contract
`may contract` MEANS `has capacity` AND `is adult`
